Constant machine addresses in unchanged kernel reductions — 2026-10-16

Selection decodes a constant 1..64-bit index, applies scale and direction,
and selects add/sub immediate for a displacement of magnitude at most 4095.
Zero aliases the base. The dynamic, large and 128-bit paths stay unchanged.
No EvoIR obligation or memory access is removed. No Lean profile is extended.

Each row measures 100,000 calls. Instructions count only the named symbol;
callees are excluded. The source and GCC-built driver are unchanged.
